    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mo>-</mo><msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mo>-</mo><msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></menclose><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></menclose><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></menclose><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></menclose></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</m